==Strategy==
This stage is just as scary as it looks with a combination of boosted peons and a terrifying team of Crocodylidae Kurocroc and Infernal Pegasus Deonil. Fortunately, there is a bit of hope, as Deonil doesn't spawn until a minute and a half after Kurocroc does which gives you enough time to cripple or with enough power, even kill Kurocroc before Deonil even spawns. The Mistress Celeboodle at the start can be taken out using [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] for a gargantuan cash boost.

==='''Recomended Units'''===
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]: A good choice for taking out the peons and chipping down both Kurocroc and Deonil.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]]/[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]:Which one you want to use is up to you, Can Can if you want to focus on the peons and Bullet Train if you just want to destroy Kurocroc.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]: With the main threats of this stage being behemoths, Courier is an obvious pick, being able to deal great damage to Kurocroc and especially Deonil if he is able to land a hit, plus he is able to take out the Wild Doges with ease taking pressure off of your frontline.
*[[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]]: Naala assists greatly in crippling Kurocroc with it even being able to hit Kurocroc with two of its three hits if Kurocroc gets knocked back. Its wave immunity allows it to use the peons as stepping stones to hit Deonil. Together with Courier, Naala can reduce Deonil to ashes.
*[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]: His Behemoth Slayer ability is enough to make him a valid pick for this stage. Though Deonil's surge immunity makes Uril unable to do much to him so only use him for Kurocroc.

==='''Recomended Ubers'''===
*[[Adventurer Kanna (Uber Rare Cat)|Fabled Adventure Girl Kanna]]: The biggest threat in this stage is a Dark Behemoth with no surge immunity so naturally Kanna can easily cripple or kill them, making this stage much easier.
*[[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine Mk 3]]: A great choice for Deonil, its Wave Shield ability protecting any backliners you may want to bring from Deonil's waves. Just watch out for Wild Doges that could be a huge threat to it.

